  "description": "An embeddable holographic SQL database for .NET: transactional (ACID with a write-ahead log), columnar storage with compiled predicates, holo-native constant-time integer aggregates, and hash joins, with an optional memory-mapped larger-than-memory tier. INT / TEXT / REAL columns and INT or TEXT/GUID primary keys. An EvalApp-backed data-parallel query path (parallel scans, group-by, top-K, and SIMD real aggregates). Integrates as an EvalApp extension — attach it to a pipeline and query it from a step — with async execution.",
